<title>USA: Mission West finds new property deal.</title>
<headline>Mission West finds new property deal.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mission West Properties said it has terminated its agreement to sell its real estate assets to Lincoln Property Co N.C. Inc, because it will sell those properties to Spieker Properties LP for $50.5 million.</p>
<p>Lincoln Property planned to buy the properties for $46.5 million, Mission West said.</p>
<p>Mission West has scheduled the meeting to vote on the deal for December 16, 1996, it said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in late December or early January 1997, Mission West said.</p>
<p>Mission West, an owner and operator of primarily Southern California properties, is 49 percent-owned by Triton Group Ltd.</p>
